The guitar is a loyal companion and the life of the party. To pick up an instrument, open the radial menu <input> and select <input>. You can play while sitting by the fire - to do this, select <input>.

To play the guitar, you can also use:
<input> - to switch chords;
<input> - to switch between minor and major chords;
<input> - to strum;
<input> - to strum upwards;
<input> - to strum downwards;
